{
  "lessonId": "L3M1L3",
  "title": "南義原生品種寶庫",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9C27B0 0%,#7B1FA2 100%)'><h1>☀️ 南義原生品種寶庫</h1><p class='subtitle'>探索 Campania, Basilicata, Puglia 的稀有珍寶</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Aglianico del Vulture - 火山之王</h2><div class='grape-profile'><div class='profile-header'><div class='origin-badge'>Basilicata - Aglianico del Vulture DOCG</div><h3>Aglianico del Vulture Superiore</h3><div class='prestige-badge'>南義 Barolo ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div></div><div class='volcanic-story'><h4>🌋 Vulture 火山風土</h4><div class='volcano-facts'><div class='fact-card'><span class='icon'>🏔️</span><h5>死火山優勢</h5><p>Vulture 火山已休眠 13 萬年，火山土壤富含礦物質，排水性極佳。</p></div><div class='fact-card'><span class='icon'>⛰️</span><h5>極端海拔</h5><p>葡萄園位於 <strong>200-900公尺</strong>，是義大利最高海拔的 Aglianico 產區。</p></div><div class='fact-card'><span class='icon'>🌡️</span><h5>巨大日夜溫差</h5><p>白天炎熱（35°C+），夜晚涼爽（15°C），完美平衡成熟度與酸度。</p></div></div></div><div class='characteristics-grid'><div class='char-card'><h5>🍷 風味特徵（年輕時）</h5><ul><li>深邃的紫黑色</li><li>黑櫻桃、黑莓</li><li>煙燻、焦油</li><li><strong>極高單寧</strong>（封閉、粗獷）</li><li>火山礦物感（石墨、火藥）</li></ul></div><div class='char-card'><h5>🏺 陳年後演變</h5><ul><li>石榴紅帶磚紅邊緣</li><li>乾玫瑰、菸草、皮革</li><li>黑松露、森林地表</li><li><strong>單寧柔化、絲滑</strong></li><li>複雜的礦物與香料層次</li></ul></div></div><div class='aging-requirement'><h4>⏳ 陳年必需性</h4><div class='aging-timeline'><div class='timeline-stage young'><span class='year'>0-5 年</span><p class='status'>❌ 不適合飲用</p><p>單寧過於封閉粗獷</p></div><div class='timeline-stage developing'><span class='year'>5-10 年</span><p class='status'>⚠️ 開始進入適飲期</p><p>單寧開始柔化</p></div><div class='timeline-stage prime'><span class='year'>10-20 年</span><p class='status'>✅ 巔峰期</p><p>複雜度爆發</p></div><div class='timeline-stage veteran'><span class='year'>20+ 年</span><p class='status'>🏆 傳奇級</p><p>頂級年份可達 40 年</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Greco di Tufo - 白葡萄傳奇</h2><div class='grape-profile'><div class='profile-header'><div class='origin-badge'>Campania - Greco di Tufo DOCG</div><h3>Greco (格雷科)</h3><div class='ancient-badge'>古希臘遺產 🏛️</div></div><div class='origin-story'><h4>📖 2500年的故事</h4><p class='history-text'>品種名稱 'Greco' 源自希臘，<strong>公元前 8 世紀</strong>由希臘殖民者帶入義大利南部。DNA 研究證實與希臘原生品種有親緣關係。</p><div class='tufo-meaning'><h5>🏔️ 'Tufo' 的意義</h5><p><strong>Tufo = 凝灰岩</strong>（火山灰沉積岩）</p><p>Greco di Tufo 的葡萄園必須位於 Tufo 凝灰岩土壤上，這種土壤賦予獨特的礦物感和鹹度。</p></div></div><div class='characteristics-grid'><div class='char-card'><h5>🍷 風味圖譜</h5><div class='flavor-layers'><div class='layer primary'>🍋 <strong>柑橘類主導：</strong>檸檬、葡萄柚、青檸</div><div class='layer secondary'>🍑 <strong>核果香氣：</strong>白桃、杏桃、黃李</div><div class='layer mineral'>🪨 <strong>礦物特徵：</strong>打火石、濕石頭、海洋鹹度</div><div class='layer herbal'>🌿 <strong>草本元素：</strong>白花、杏仁、蜂蜜</div></div></div><div class='char-card'><h5>🔬 結構特點</h5><ul><li><strong>酸度：</strong>極高（義大利最高之一）</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>12.5-14%</li><li><strong>酒體：</strong>中飽滿、有重量感</li><li><strong>陳年潛力：</strong>10-20 年（頂級）</li><li><strong>獨特性：</strong>高酸 + 高酒精的罕見組合</li></ul></div></div><div class='expert-insight'><h4>💡 專家洞察</h4><p>Greco di Tufo 是<strong>少數能與勃根地特級園白酒匹敵</strong>的義大利白葡萄酒。陳年 10 年以上的頂級酒款會發展出蜂蠟、汽油、蜂蜜等複雜香氣，類似老年份 Riesling。</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Fiano di Avellino - 芳香女王</h2><div class='grape-profile'><div class='profile-header'><div class='origin-badge'>Campania - Fiano di Avellino DOCG</div><h3>Fiano (菲亞諾)</h3><div class='quality-badge'>Campania 三大白葡萄之一</div></div><div class='characteristics-grid'><div class='char-card aromatic'><h5>🌸 芳香炸彈</h5><div class='aroma-profile'><div class='aroma-group'><h6>🌼 花香</h6><ul><li>金合歡花</li><li>橙花</li><li>茉莉</li></ul></div><div class='aroma-group'><h6>🍯 蜂蜜與堅果</h6><ul><li>蜂蜜</li><li>榛果</li><li>杏仁糖</li></ul></div><div class='aroma-group'><h6>🍐 水果</h6><ul><li>西洋梨</li><li>烤蘋果</li><li>熱帶水果</li></ul></div></div></div><div class='char-card structure'><h5>📊 結構分析</h5><ul><li><strong>酸度：</strong>中高（比 Greco 略低）</li><li><strong>酒體：</strong>飽滿、圓潤</li><li><strong>酒精度：</strong>13-14%</li><li><strong>質地：</strong>絲滑、油質感</li><li><strong>陳年：</strong>5-15 年</li></ul><div class='comparison-note'>💡 比 Greco 更豐富飽滿，但酸度稍低</div></div></div><div class='terroir-section'><h4>🗺️ Avellino 山區風土</h4><div class='terroir-grid'><div class='terroir-item'><span class='icon'>⛰️</span><h6>海拔</h6><p>400-700 公尺</p></div><div class='terroir-item'><span class='icon'>🌡️</span><h6>氣候</h6><p>內陸涼爽、日夜溫差大</p></div><div class='terroir-item'><span class='icon'>🪨</span><h6>土壤</h6><p>火山土、凝灰岩、石灰岩</p></div><div class='terroir-item'><span class='icon'>💨</span><h6>風</h6><p>來自 Apennines 山的涼風</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Primitivo di Manduria - Puglia 的力量</h2><div class='grape-profile'><div class='profile-header'><div class='origin-badge'>Puglia - Primitivo di Manduria DOCG</div><h3>Primitivo (普里米蒂沃)</h3><div class='dna-badge'>= Zinfandel (DNA 相同)</div></div><div class='identity-crisis'><h4>🧬 身份之謎</h4><div class='identity-timeline'><div class='identity-event'><span class='year'>1968</span><p>美國加州大學發現 <strong>Primitivo = Zinfandel</strong>（DNA 完全相同）</p></div><div class='identity-event'><span class='year'>2002</span><p>進一步研究發現原始品種是克羅埃西亞的 <strong>Crljenak Kaštelanski</strong></p></div><div class='identity-event'><span class='year'>現在</span><p>三個名字代表三種不同的風格解讀</p></div></div></div><div class='style-comparison'><h4>🌍 Primitivo vs Zinfandel 風格差異</h4><table class='comparison-table'><tr><th>特性</th><th>Primitivo (義大利)</th><th>Zinfandel (加州)</th></tr><tr><td><strong>氣候</strong></td><td>地中海炎熱乾燥</td><td>溫暖但海洋影響</td></tr><tr><td><strong>酒精度</strong></td><td>14-16%（極高）</td><td>14-15.5%</td></tr><tr><td><strong>風格</strong></td><td>濃郁、甜美、果醬感</td><td>更fresh、香料更明顯</td></tr><tr><td><strong>單寧</strong></td><td>柔軟、圓潤</td><td>稍粗獷</td></tr><tr><td><strong>主要風味</strong></td><td>李子乾、無花果、巧克力</td><td>黑莓、黑胡椒、香料</td></tr><tr><td><strong>陳年潛力</strong></td><td>5-10 年（DOCG）</td><td>5-15 年（頂級）</td></tr></table></div><div class='manduria-speciality'><h4>🏆 Primitivo di Manduria 特殊性</h4><div class='speciality-points'><div class='point-card'><h6>🍇 超成熟採收</h6><p>Primitivo 名稱源自「提早成熟」，但在 Manduria 經常<strong>過度成熟採收</strong>，產生葡萄乾般的濃縮風味。</p></div><div class='point-card'><h6>🌞 極端炎熱</h6><p>Manduria 是義大利最熱的產區之一，夏季常超過 40°C，造就極高糖分和酒精度。</p></div><div class='point-card'><h6>🍷 Dolce Naturale</h6><p>傳統甜型版本（Dolce Naturale）使用半風乾葡萄，酒精度可達 16-18%，殘糖 50-100 g/L。</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📊 四大南義品種全面對比</h2><div class='mega-comparison'><table class='professional-table'><thead><tr><th rowspan='2' class='category-header'>特性</th><th colspan='2'>Basilicata</th><th colspan='2'>Campania</th></tr><tr><th>Aglianico del Vulture</th><th>-</th><th>Greco di Tufo</th><th>Fiano di Avellino</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>顏色</strong></td><td>🔴 紅葡萄</td><td>-</td><td>⚪ 白葡萄</td><td>⚪ 白葡萄</td></tr><tr><td><strong>DOCG年份</strong></td><td>2011</td><td>-</td><td>2003</td><td>2003</td></tr><tr><td><strong>氣候影響</strong></td><td>火山、極端溫差</td><td>-</td><td>火山土、內陸</td><td>山區、涼爽</td></tr><tr><td><strong>酸度</strong></td><td>極高</td><td>-</td><td>極高</td><td>中高</td></tr><tr><td><strong>酒體</strong></td><td>飽滿、結構強</td><td>-</td><td>中飽滿、緊實</td><td>飽滿、圓潤</td></tr><tr><td><strong>陳年需求</strong></td><td>必須（10+ 年）</td><td>-</td><td>可陳年（5-20 年）</td><td>可陳年（5-15 年）</td></tr><tr><td><strong>價格帶</strong></td><td>€€€-€€€€€</td><td>-</td><td>€€-€€€€</td><td>€€-€€€€</td></tr><tr><td><strong>國際認可度</strong></td><td>高（南義 Barolo）</td><td>-</td><td>中高（專業圈）</td><td>中高（專業圈）</td></tr></tbody></table><div class='apulia-section'><h5>Puglia 代表</h5><div class='primitivo-row'><div class='wine-name'><strong>Primitivo di Manduria DOCG</strong></div><div class='wine-specs'><span>🔴 紅葡萄</span><span>2011 DOCG</span><span>極高糖分/酒精</span><span>5-10 年陳年</span><span>€€-€€€€</span><span>大眾認可度高</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏅 頂級生產者指南</h2><div class='producers-by-region'><div class='region-producers'><div class='region-header vulture-header'><h4>🌋 Basilicata - Aglianico del Vulture</h4></div><div class='winery-showcase'><div class='winery'><h5>Elena Fucci</h5><div class='badges'><span class='badge biodynamic'>生物動力法</span><span class='badge critic'>WA 96+</span></div><p class='flagship'>旗艦酒款：Titolo</p><p class='price'>€80-120</p></div><div class='winery'><h5>Cantine del Notaio</h5><div class='badges'><span class='badge traditional'>傳統 Superiore</span></div><p class='flagship'>旗艦酒款：Il Repertorio</p><p class='price'>€40-60</p></div><div class='winery'><h5>Paternoster</h5><div class='badges'><span class='badge historic'>歷史酒莊</span></div><p class='flagship'>旗艦酒款：Don Anselmo</p><p class='price'>€50-80</p></div></div></div><div class='region-producers'><div class='region-header campania-header'><h4>🏛️ Campania - Greco & Fiano</h4></div><div class='winery-showcase'><div class='winery'><h5>Feudi di San Gregorio</h5><div class='badges'><span class='badge modern'>現代先驅</span><span class='badge international'>國際知名</span></div><p class='flagship'>Greco: Cutizzi | Fiano: Pietracalda</p><p class='price'>€25-50</p></div><div class='winery'><h5>Mastroberardino</h5><div class='badges'><span class='badge legendary'>傳奇家族</span></div><p class='flagship'>Greco: Nova Serra | Fiano: Radici</p><p class='price'>€30-60</p></div><div class='winery'><h5>Benito Ferrara</h5><div class='badges'><span class='badge terroir'>風土至上</span></div><p class='flagship'>Fiano: Vigna Cicogna</p><p class='price'>€35-55</p></div></div></div><div class='region-producers'><div class='region-header puglia-header'><h4>☀️ Puglia - Primitivo</h4></div><div class='winery-showcase'><div class='winery'><h5>A-Mano</h5><div class='badges'><span class='badge value'>超值首選</span></div><p class='flagship'>Primitivo di Manduria</p><p class='price'>€12-18</p></div><div class='winery'><h5>Gianfranco Fino</h5><div class='badges'><span class='badge cult'>Cult Producer</span><span class='badge critic'>WA 98+</span></div><p class='flagship'>ES | Primitivo di Manduria</p><p class='price'>€80-150</p></div><div class='winery'><h5>Masseria Li Veli</h5><div class='badges'><span class='badge organic'>有機認證</span></div><p class='flagship'>Orion | Askos</p><p class='price'>€25-45</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍴 南義風土配餐</h2><div class='regional-pairing'><div class='pairing-region'><h4>🌋 Aglianico del Vulture 配餐</h4><div class='pairing-principle'>原則：強勁單寧需要油脂和蛋白質</div><div class='dishes'><div class='dish'>🥩 <strong>Tagliata 牛排</strong> - 單寧切開油脂</div><div class='dish'>🍖 <strong>燉羊肉</strong> - 長時間烹調匹配陳年酒</div><div class='dish'>🧀 <strong>Pecorino 陳年起司</strong> - 鹹度匹配礦物感</div><div class='dish'>🍝 <strong>Ragù Lucano</strong> - Basilicata 傳統肉醬</div></div></div><div class='pairing-region'><h4>🏛️ Greco di Tufo 配餐</h4><div class='pairing-principle'>原則：高酸度搭配油脂和海鮮</div><div class='dishes'><div class='dish'>🦪 <strong>生蠔</strong> - 礦物感完美匹配</div><div class='dish'>🐙 <strong>章魚沙拉</strong> - 檸檬酸度呼應</div><div class='dish'>🍝 <strong>Vongole 蛤蜊麵</strong> - Campania 經典</div><div class='dish'>🧀 <strong>Burrata</strong> - 奶油感平衡酸度</div></div></div><div class='pairing-region'><h4>🌸 Fiano di Avellino 配餐</h4><div class='pairing-principle'>原則：芳香與飽滿度需要風味豐富的菜餚</div><div class='dishes'><div class='dish'>🦐 <strong>龍蝦</strong> - 豐富甲殼類</div><div class='dish'>🍄 <strong>松露燉飯</strong> - 複雜香氣匹配</div><div class='dish'>🐟 <strong>烤鱸魚</strong> - 油質魚類</div><div class='dish'>🥘 <strong>海鮮湯</strong> - Campania 傳統</div></div></div><div class='pairing-region'><h4>☀️ Primitivo 配餐</h4><div class='pairing-principle'>原則：高酒精和甜美果味搭配辛香料理</div><div class='dishes'><div class='dish'>🍖 <strong>BBQ 烤肉</strong> - 焦糖化風味</div><div class='dish'>🍕 <strong>辣味披薩</strong> - 酒精平衡辣度</div><div class='dish'>🥘 <strong>Orecchiette 耳朵麵</strong> - Puglia 傳統</div><div class='dish'>🧀 <strong>Burrata + 番茄</strong> - 地域配對</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 專家重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ Aglianico del Vulture 是南義的「Barolo」，需要 10+ 年陳年</div><div class='point'>✓ Vulture 火山土壤賦予獨特的礦物感和火藥香氣</div><div class='point'>✓ Greco di Tufo 擁有義大利白酒中最高的酸度之一</div><div class='point'>✓ Greco 的名字源自古希臘，有 2500 年歷史</div><div class='point'>✓ Fiano 以芳香著稱，比 Greco 更飽滿圓潤</div><div class='point'>✓ Primitivo = Zinfandel (DNA 相同），但風格差異明顯</div><div class='point'>✓ Primitivo di Manduria 是義大利酒精度最高的干型紅酒之一</div><div class='point'>✓ 南義品種都受益於火山土和極端氣候</div></div></section></div><style>.grape-profile{background:#fff;padding:40px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}.profile-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:35px;padding-bottom:25px;border-bottom:4px solid #9C27B0}.origin-badge{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#9C27B0,#7B1FA2);color:#fff;padding:10px 25px;border-radius:30px;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(156,39,176,.3)}.profile-header h3{font-size:2.3rem;margin:18px 0;color:#2c3e50;font-weight:800}.prestige-badge,.ancient-badge,.quality-badge,.dna-badge{display:inline-block;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:25px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;margin-top:10px}.prestige-badge{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff6b6b,#c92a2a);color:#fff}.ancient-badge{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd700,#ffb700);color:#333}.quality-badge{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4caf50,#388e3c);color:#fff}.dna-badge{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2196f3,#1565c0);color:#fff}.volcanic-story{margin:30px 0}.volcanic-story h4{color:#d32f2f;font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:25px;text-align:center}.volcano-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.fact-card{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#ffebee,#ffcdd2);padding:25px;border-radius:15px;text-align:center;border-top:4px solid #d32f2f}.fact-card .icon{font-size:3rem;display:block;margin-bottom:15px}.fact-card h5{margin:10px 0;color:#d32f2f;font-size:1.2rem}.fact-card p{margin:10px 0 0;line-height:1.7;color:#2c3e50}.fact-card strong{color:#b71c1c}.characteristics-grid{display:grid;grid-templ